 "brief_title": "A Research Study to See How Well New Weekly Medicine IcoSema, Which is a Combination of Insulin Icodec and Semaglutide, Controls Blood Sugar Levels in People With Type 2 Diabetes (T2D), Compared to Daily Insulin Glargine (COMBINE 4)",
 "official_title": "A 40-week Study Comparing the Efficacy and Safety of Once Weekly IcoSema and Daily Insulin Glargine 100 Units/mL in Participants With Type 2 Diabetes Inadequately Controlled on Oral Anti Diabetic Drugs COMBINE 4",
